# Local secrets for `wrangler dev` — copy to `.dev.vars`:
#   cp .dev.vars.example .dev.vars
# In production use `wrangler secret put <NAME>` instead.

# All AI (Whisper transcription + Persian explanations + word definitions) runs on the
# Workers AI binding ([ai] in wrangler.toml). No provider API key is required.

# Access control. Leave UNSET locally to keep the app open in dev.
# Accepts one passcode or a comma-separated list to share with a few friends:
#   APP_PASSCODE=secret123
#   APP_PASSCODE=pass1,pass2,pass3
# APP_PASSCODE=secret123

# Optional: separate secret for signing session tokens. Falls back to APP_PASSCODE if unset.
# AUTH_SECRET=change-me-to-a-long-random-string
